{"left": {"type": "note", "id": "NOTE-20261112-1e5579"}, "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261110-df055c"}, "relation_type": "reframes", "note": "ビザンチン将軍問題のscope_noteに残る非同期の未読範囲を読み、FLP原典で応答。", "created_at": "2026-11-12", "relation_id": "REL-20261112-dcc62d"}
